  "title": "Amaravati Quantum Valley’s Innovation Blueprint",
  "summary": "The Hindu National reports that Amaravati Quantum Valley aims to become a global leader in quantum computing by 2030, competing with established centers in the U.S., Singapore, and Australia. The first major test vision includes an IBM Quantum System being installed in February 2027.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The first major test vision of building an indigenous premier deep tech hub arrives soon as an IBM Quantum System, already en route from the U.S., will be installed on February 3, 2027, at Amaravati Quantum Valley; homegrown breakthroughs are already emerging from Amaravati 1Q and Amaravati 1S labs, led by Q SHIVA and NAADA",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
